{1 = 1-14}
9=1.	How many there are! How many cows there are! 
15=2.	How many cattle of @wDN{Suen} there are! 
19=3.	The dark ones are translucent lapis lazuli; 
23=4.	the pale cows are the light of the risen moon. 
27=5.	The little ones trickle down like barleycorns for you; 
31=6.	the large ones throng together like wild bulls for you. 
35=7.	The Glory of Heaven @noteref{Suen} has undone the halters of the numerous cows in his teeming herd. 
39=8.	He has poured out milk from the beautiful cows at the offering table; 
43=9.	his bright hands ever pour the milk. 
47=10.	After my king has completed the work, 
51=11.	@wDN{Suen} …… the shining halter …… the cows, 
55=12.	he …… the cows, 
59=13.	he …… the cows. 
63=14.	He acts as the herder of the cows. 

{15 = 15-20}
67=15.	His own mother, the lady of @wSN{Nibru}, 
71=16.	speaks a prayer to the lord in his desert: 
75=17.	@q[Ninlil,Nanna]{“A prayer, O shepherd! A prayer! 
79=18.	May the cows be numerous for you in the good desert. 
83=19.	When you arrive at nightfall, may you renew the @wTN{E-kur}, 
87=20.	the highly prized sanctuary.”} 

{21 = 21-24}
91=21.	He is its lover, he is its lover, 
95=22.	he is the lord, the @wTN{E-kur's} lover! 
99=23.	He is the man of delight to @wDN{Enlil}, 
103=24.	he is @wDN{Suen}, the cry of joy of his own mother. 

{25 = 25-36}
107=25.	The mother who bore him speaks kindly from her loving heart to @wDN{Suen}: 
111=26.	@q[Ninlil,Suen]{“You are the beloved of the heart who calms the heart, 
115=27.	@wDN{Suen}, 
119=28.	shining calf who grew fat on the holy lap; 
123=29.	you can wish in your heart for anything! 
127=30.	You can desire everything precious to the heart! 
131=31.	……, splendour of the @wTN{E-kur}, 
135=32.	make your wish on @wDN{Enlil's} lap. May you create glory in heaven! 
139=33.	May the @wTN{E-kur} sing a song of joy about you, 
143=34.	may the people call upon your life, 
147=35.	@wDN{Suen}, 
151=36.	may you be supreme in heaven and earth!”} 

{37 = 37-40}
155=37.	He has poured out milk from the …… cows at the offering table, 
