{41 = 41-49}
171=41.	His mother speaks kindly in joy to the king, 
175=42.	the holy barge which travels across the sky: 
179=43.	@q[Ninlil,Nanna]{“My wild bull whom @wDN{An} has well called, 
183=44.	your name is respected in all lands. 
187=45.	Lord of the holy herd who consecrates the purification rites, 
191=46.	seed engendered in a holy shrine, shining halter, 
