199=48.	seed engendered in the fields, beloved of holy @wDN{An}! 
203=49.	@wDN{An} has conferred on you the shepherding of the Land!”} 

{50 = 50-60}
207=50.	@q{“@wDN{Enlil} has named you with a good renown -- you are the son of @wDN{Enlil} whose speech is just. 
211=51.	In his elevated heart @wDN{An} has bestowed kingship on you. 
215=52.	He has chosen your city @wSN{Urim} in his heart. 
219=53.	For you he has brought fish and birds to the princely river. 
223=54.	First-born of @wDN{Enlil}, who …… the rank of lord, 
227=55.	he has bestowed on you the kingship of heaven. 
231=56.	You are a god dressed in beauty in the heavens. 
235=57.	Your moonlight is holy and bright, 
239=58.	and because like @wDN{Utu} you are a shepherd of the Land, 
